{
	"info": {
		"name": "LibraLink API Tests",
		"description": "Complete API test collection for LibraLink Backend - All endpoints with clean request bodies.\n\nSETUP:\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Set the 'baseUrl' variable to your backend URL (default: http://localhost:8080)\n3. Run Auth > Login for each role to get JWT tokens\n4. Tokens are auto-saved to role-specific variables\n5. All authenticated requests use the appropriate token variable automatically",
